(3133762, 438524, 69121, '<td valign="top">Maybe you could use a reflector to give just a tiny bit of light to the bottom left corner so that there isn''t so much area that is totaly blacked out.</td>', 'Maybe you could use a reflector to give just a tiny bit of light to the bottom left corner so that there isn''t so much area that is totaly blacked out.', '2006-12-20 01:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
