(3133772, 438524, 66515, '<td valign="top">The shadows seem quite underexposed to me. If there was a bit more detail showing I think it would be more effective. You also might need a deeper depth of field to get the whole glove sharp as the outside is terrifically sharpened whereas the palm and especially the fingers are a touch blurry.<br/> <br/>Great idea for the challenge however.</td>', 'The shadows seem quite underexposed to me. If there was a bit more detail showing I think it would be more effective. You also might need a deeper depth of field to get the whole glove sharp as the outside is terrifically sharpened whereas the palm and especially the fingers are a touch blurry. Great idea for the challenge however.', '2006-12-20 01:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133774, 440256, 67335, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, could be my monitor though. I like the deatil in the skin and headwear.</td>', 'A bit dark, could be my monitor though. I like the deatil in the skin and headwear.', '2006-12-20 01:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133778, 440356, 66515, '<td valign="top">This shot is a bit noisy and unfortunately, the color of tower doesn''t say "brown" to me.</td>', 'This shot is a bit noisy and unfortunately, the color of tower doesn''t say "brown" to me.', '2006-12-20 01:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133780, 440400, 66515, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the blur is intentional here but I do find it distracting.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the blur is intentional here but I do find it distracting.', '2006-12-20 01:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133781, 440062, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and composition of this shot. I consider brown to be a warm color and this really gives a feeling of comfort.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and composition of this shot. I consider brown to be a warm color and this really gives a feeling of comfort.', '2006-12-20 01:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133782, 440450, 69260, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, composition and colours are great and the motion of the horse running is wonderfully perceptible !<br/>I like this one very much, congratulations.</td>', 'Excellent picture, composition and colours are great and the motion of the horse running is wonderfully perceptible !I like this one very much, congratulations.', '2006-12-20 01:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133783, 439258, 69121, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked to have seen more of the subject. If your lens isn''t wide enough perhaps another angle would''ve made this more interesting. Good job with lighting!</td>', 'I would''ve liked to have seen more of the subject. If your lens isn''t wide enough perhaps another angle would''ve made this more interesting. Good job with lighting!', '2006-12-20 01:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133785, 440506, 66515, '<td valign="top">The thick border detracts from the image. I am also not really seeing brown as a focus so much as just another color amongst others.</td>', 'The thick border detracts from the image. I am also not really seeing brown as a focus so much as just another color amongst others.', '2006-12-20 01:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3133788, 439900, 66515, '<td valign="top">This angle seems somewhat "stunted". I feel like there should be more in the picture.</td>', 'This angle seems somewhat "stunted". I feel like there should be more in the picture.', '2006-12-20 01:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
