(3135377, 438344, 67537, '<td valign="top">I feel like these arent brown at all...the bottom leaf looks red, and the top looks yellow. Is this just because of the lighting, or does this photo not belong in this competition? Dont get me wrong, I like the photo a lot...just not sure if this is the competition for it.</td>', 'I feel like these arent brown at all...the bottom leaf looks red, and the top looks yellow. Is this just because of the lighting, or does this photo not belong in this competition? Dont get me wrong, I like the photo a lot...just not sure if this is the competition for it.', '2006-12-20 11:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135378, 440647, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Excellent DOF and the deer in the background is a wonderful addition.</td>', 'Beautiful! Excellent DOF and the deer in the background is a wonderful addition.', '2006-12-20 11:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135379, 440452, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful in its simplicity!</td>', 'Beautiful in its simplicity!', '2006-12-20 11:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
