(3135381, 440365, 43774, '<td valign="top">He''s gorgeous!</td>', 'He''s gorgeous!', '2006-12-20 11:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135382, 440509, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely! That little green thing in the center adds just enough contrast and interest to the dead brown leaves.</td>', 'Lovely! That little green thing in the center adds just enough contrast and interest to the dead brown leaves.', '2006-12-20 11:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135391, 440508, 67537, '<td valign="top">Your title should be different, as according to your title the WATER should be the main focus, but really, the water is white, not brown...so it doesnt belong in this competition. Now, if your focus should be the leaves and twigs that would be one thing...but my eye still wants to go to the water, so the leaves and twigs should be larger or centered, to take the focus to them.</td>', 'Your title should be different, as according to your title the WATER should be the main focus, but really, the water is white, not brown...so it doesnt belong in this competition. Now, if your focus should be the leaves and twigs that would be one thing...but my eye still wants to go to the water, so the leaves and twigs should be larger or centered, to take the focus to them.', '2006-12-20 11:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135394, 440381, 31443, '<td valign="top">Mmmm looks so yummie, lovely shades of brown and the container is really neat..</td>', 'Mmmm looks so yummie, lovely shades of brown and the container is really neat..', '2006-12-20 11:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135396, 440048, 31443, '<td valign="top">This looks really nice, wonder what berries these are, if they are berries..great bokeh</td>', 'This looks really nice, wonder what berries these are, if they are berries..great bokeh', '2006-12-20 11:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135410, 439133, 67537, '<td valign="top">I like the title and photo...good job. The only critique I have would be, that I wish the leaves at the bottom werent soo blurry. It distracts my attention away from the main focus. I know this was a basic editing challenge, so theres not much you could have done about it...but thats just my opinion. Good effort!</td>', 'I like the title and photo...good job. The only critique I have would be, that I wish the leaves at the bottom werent soo blurry. It distracts my attention away from the main focus. I know this was a basic editing challenge, so theres not much you could have done about it...but thats just my opinion. Good effort!', '2006-12-20 11:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135413, 439080, 67537, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo had more lighting, it''s a little too dark for the main focus to be the grass. It''s hard to see! Good effort!</td>', 'I wish this photo had more lighting, it''s a little too dark for the main focus to be the grass. It''s hard to see! Good effort!', '2006-12-20 11:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135415, 438886, 67537, '<td valign="top">Not sure about your title....I''m a little confused about what this photo really is. I love all of the water droplets, however, the challenge was "brown" and what is supposed to be the main focus, is blurry. I feel like you need a sharper focus on the brown item, instead of the sharp focus being on all of the water droplets. Good effort!</td>', 'Not sure about your title....I''m a little confused about what this photo really is. I love all of the water droplets, however, the challenge was "brown" and what is supposed to be the main focus, is blurry. I feel like you need a sharper focus on the brown item, instead of the sharp focus being on all of the water droplets. Good effort!', '2006-12-20 11:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135420, 440296, 67537, '<td valign="top">I know this is a basic editing challenge, but had it been an advanced one, I would really like to see those tags off of the cows ears. They are just too bright for the photo, and take attention off of the cow. I really like the photo, but I think it would be even better if those tags were edited out....nothing you could have done for this competition. Good job!</td>', 'I know this is a basic editing challenge, but had it been an advanced one, I would really like to see those tags off of the cows ears. They are just too bright for the photo, and take attention off of the cow. I really like the photo, but I think it would be even better if those tags were edited out....nothing you could have done for this competition. Good job!', '2006-12-20 11:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135426, 439839, 67537, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this photo better, if the paw? was not such a big blur in the right hand corner. If it were a smaller part of the picture then it wouldnt have been a problem..I just think its too large.</td>', 'I would have liked this photo better, if the paw? was not such a big blur in the right hand corner. If it were a smaller part of the picture then it wouldnt have been a problem..I just think its too large.', '2006-12-20 11:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135435, 439473, 67537, '<td valign="top">I wish the magazine wasnt so vibrant of a color, it takes the eye off of the main "brown" focus. Thats what makes this challenege so unique, is that you have to make brown (which is a non-discript color) the main attention. Right now, my focus keeps going to the red magazine. Nice effort!</td>', 'I wish the magazine wasnt so vibrant of a color, it takes the eye off of the main "brown" focus. Thats what makes this challenege so unique, is that you have to make brown (which is a non-discript color) the main attention. Right now, my focus keeps going to the red magazine. Nice effort!', '2006-12-20 11:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
