(3137984, 440511, 68797, '<td valign="top">I like it in one way, but on the other hand I''m trying to figure out what went wrong here. Can''t put my finger on it, seems he has either a pigment skin condition ( I know I do and it looks about the same, or it''s a bad ''replace colour'' action. The beard and collar look funny to me. And I don''t like the overlit spot on his cheeck. (is overlit the right word, I mean the bright light)</td>', 'I like it in one way, but on the other hand I''m trying to figure out what went wrong here. Can''t put my finger on it, seems he has either a pigment skin condition ( I know I do and it looks about the same, or it''s a bad ''replace colour'' action. The beard and collar look funny to me. And I don''t like the overlit spot on his cheeck. (is overlit the right word, I mean the bright light)', '2006-12-21 03:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
