(3138244, 439347, 69121, '<td valign="top">How do they see out of those things? I wish the image didn''t get quite so blurry towards the top right corner.</td>', 'How do they see out of those things? I wish the image didn''t get quite so blurry towards the top right corner.', '2006-12-21 06:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138245, 440365, 69121, '<td valign="top">Very sharp.</td>', 'Very sharp.', '2006-12-21 06:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138246, 440062, 69121, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the window to reflect the sun.</td>', 'I like how you used the window to reflect the sun.', '2006-12-21 06:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138247, 438934, 69121, '<td valign="top">Go Woody!</td>', 'Go Woody!', '2006-12-21 06:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138249, 440647, 69121, '<td valign="top">Very sharp!</td>', 'Very sharp!', '2006-12-21 06:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138250, 440450, 69183, '<td valign="top">This would have been excellent if the head wasn''t blurred, and if the centre of focus was the head rather than the torso. I do like the way the legs are moving tho. Nice attempt - 7</td>', 'This would have been excellent if the head wasn''t blurred, and if the centre of focus was the head rather than the torso. I do like the way the legs are moving tho. Nice attempt - 7', '2006-12-21 06:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138251, 440322, 69121, '<td valign="top">What are those green things on the coffee beans?</td>', 'What are those green things on the coffee beans?', '2006-12-21 06:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138253, 439515, 69121, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the placement of your candles. They are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I don''t understand the placement of your candles. They are a bit distracting.', '2006-12-21 06:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138254, 440187, 69121, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. The light inside the basket is just a bit too strong.</td>', 'Nice colors. The light inside the basket is just a bit too strong.', '2006-12-21 06:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138255, 440483, 69121, '<td valign="top">I like the glare from the sun in the upper left corner. I would like to see it a little bigger though. Very nice picture.</td>', 'I like the glare from the sun in the upper left corner. I would like to see it a little bigger though. Very nice picture.', '2006-12-21 06:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138256, 439901, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot, but a Nescafe mug? Ewwwww! ;-)</td>', 'Nicely composed shot, but a Nescafe mug? Ewwwww! ;-)', '2006-12-21 06:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138258, 440145, 69121, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2006-12-21 06:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138260, 440403, 69121, '<td valign="top">Good job.</td>', 'Good job.', '2006-12-21 06:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138261, 438198, 69121, '<td valign="top">The colors here are great.</td>', 'The colors here are great.', '2006-12-21 06:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138264, 440547, 69183, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped this a bit closer at the top to remove the hose and clothes/person in the background; they''re distracting and don''t add to the photo.</td>', 'I''d have cropped this a bit closer at the top to remove the hose and clothes/person in the background; they''re distracting and don''t add to the photo.', '2006-12-21 06:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138266, 439740, 69121, '<td valign="top">Is this on the wheel of your car? How did that happen?</td>', 'Is this on the wheel of your car? How did that happen?', '2006-12-21 06:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138267, 439133, 69121, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. Good work.</td>', 'I really like this photo. Good work.', '2006-12-21 06:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138276, 438387, 69183, '<td valign="top">Very grainy image and not really focussed on any part of the face.</td>', 'Very grainy image and not really focussed on any part of the face.', '2006-12-21 06:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138279, 439319, 69183, '<td valign="top">Newcastle Brown in a *Guiness* glass? Are you mad? ;)  Oh right, comments on the photo: nicely lit, like the warm colours, bit of an odd angle to shoot from tho.</td>', 'Newcastle Brown in a *Guiness* glass? Are you mad? ;)  Oh right, comments on the photo: nicely lit, like the warm colours, bit of an odd angle to shoot from tho.', '2006-12-21 06:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138280, 440542, 43565, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I would prefer sharper focus.</td>', 'Great idea, but I would prefer sharper focus.', '2006-12-21 06:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138282, 439330, 43565, '<td valign="top">Her nose seems to draw my attention more than her eyes do.  Not really the most flattering shot, and I would like sharper focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Her nose seems to draw my attention more than her eyes do.  Not really the most flattering shot, and I would like sharper focus on the eyes.', '2006-12-21 06:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138283, 440501, 69183, '<td valign="top">LOL, like it. I get the feeling that this would have done much better with more post-processing. There''s some sensor dust or hot pixels that could be cloned out, the focus is a bit off, and you could make much more of the richer brown colours in the coat.</td>', 'LOL, like it. I get the feeling that this would have done much better with more post-processing. There''s some sensor dust or hot pixels that could be cloned out, the focus is a bit off, and you could make much more of the richer brown colours in the coat.', '2006-12-21 06:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138288, 438473, 69183, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2006-12-21 06:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138289, 439302, 69183, '<td valign="top">The DOF is so shallow on this, I feel like I''m missing out on a whole lot of detail that I really want to see in the foreground leaves. Maybe a slightly deeper DOF and softer background light?</td>', 'The DOF is so shallow on this, I feel like I''m missing out on a whole lot of detail that I really want to see in the foreground leaves. Maybe a slightly deeper DOF and softer background light?', '2006-12-21 06:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138290, 440187, 43565, '<td valign="top">The basket and the background are brown, but the subject is not brown.  I think this shot would have been better without the bag.</td>', 'The basket and the background are brown, but the subject is not brown.  I think this shot would have been better without the bag.', '2006-12-21 06:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138291, 440145, 43565, '<td valign="top">This looks orange instead of brown to me.</td>', 'This looks orange instead of brown to me.', '2006-12-21 06:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138292, 440625, 43565, '<td valign="top">The DOF is too shallow for me.</td>', 'The DOF is too shallow for me.', '2006-12-21 06:34:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3138293, 440194, 43565, '<td valign="top">The focus is too soft for me.</td>', 'The focus is too soft for me.', '2006-12-21 06:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138294, 439812, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the title means!</td>', 'Not sure what the title means!', '2006-12-21 06:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138295, 440606, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice. I was wondering whether anyone would be brave enough to desaturate the shot and leave it to the viewer''s interpretation, rather than oversaturate in an attempt to stand out. Top stuff! 10</td>', 'Nice. I was wondering whether anyone would be brave enough to desaturate the shot and leave it to the viewer''s interpretation, rather than oversaturate in an attempt to stand out. Top stuff! 10', '2006-12-21 06:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138296, 440078, 69183, '<td valign="top">This is well shot. I found it hard to work out whether it''s small pebbles close up or mountains in the distance or both. Love it.</td>', 'This is well shot. I found it hard to work out whether it''s small pebbles close up or mountains in the distance or both. Love it.', '2006-12-21 06:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138297, 439302, 68797, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I like this one. What is that grey circle?</td>', 'Can''t say I like this one. What is that grey circle?', '2006-12-21 06:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138298, 440669, 69183, '<td valign="top">Cool, but you really wanna use a thicker sauce or coat the strawberries a few times first - it seems a bit anaemic as it stands.</td>', 'Cool, but you really wanna use a thicker sauce or coat the strawberries a few times first - it seems a bit anaemic as it stands.', '2006-12-21 06:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138301, 440357, 69183, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the drink doesn''t look appetising :)  Maybe making the drink a really dark cocoa colour or using darker chocolates would have provided a contrast; as it is they''re both very similar shades of brown.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the drink doesn''t look appetising :)  Maybe making the drink a really dark cocoa colour or using darker chocolates would have provided a contrast; as it is they''re both very similar shades of brown.', '2006-12-21 06:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138303, 438821, 68797, '<td valign="top">nice shot, don''t have any other comment.</td>', 'nice shot, don''t have any other comment.', '2006-12-21 06:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138306, 440468, 69183, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and colours. I''d like to find out what PP you did - purely in the interests of learning for myself!</td>', 'Love the composition and colours. I''d like to find out what PP you did - purely in the interests of learning for myself!', '2006-12-21 06:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138307, 440415, 69183, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that this is cut off at the bottom</td>', 'It''s a shame that this is cut off at the bottom', '2006-12-21 06:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138309, 440344, 69183, '<td valign="top">Well caught - either that or your milk arrives in some pretty freaky shapes :)</td>', 'Well caught - either that or your milk arrives in some pretty freaky shapes :)', '2006-12-21 06:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138312, 439676, 69183, '<td valign="top">hehehe. Like it.</td>', 'hehehe. Like it.', '2006-12-21 06:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138315, 439562, 69183, '<td valign="top">This would be so much stronger if the bottom left corner wasn''t obscured by shadow. The light and occasional green leaf are very nice.</td>', 'This would be so much stronger if the bottom left corner wasn''t obscured by shadow. The light and occasional green leaf are very nice.', '2006-12-21 06:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138319, 440467, 69183, '<td valign="top">the flash (or lighting) makes this really harsh.  A softer light would have bought out the colours much better.</td>', 'the flash (or lighting) makes this really harsh.  A softer light would have bought out the colours much better.', '2006-12-21 06:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138321, 440356, 69121, '<td valign="top">That is a cool view point of a much photographed structure. I like this.</td>', 'That is a cool view point of a much photographed structure. I like this.', '2006-12-21 06:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138323, 440173, 69121, '<td valign="top">I wish I could understand what we were looking at here. Is this a deck? A musical instrument?</td>', 'I wish I could understand what we were looking at here. Is this a deck? A musical instrument?', '2006-12-21 06:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138325, 440661, 69121, '<td valign="top">This man is probably thinking, "would you put down the dang camera and give me a hand here"?!?</td>', 'This man is probably thinking, "would you put down the dang camera and give me a hand here"?!?', '2006-12-21 06:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138326, 440536, 69121, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2006-12-21 06:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138327, 440485, 69121, '<td valign="top">This is the first one of a coffee mug and beans that I actually like. Good job!</td>', 'This is the first one of a coffee mug and beans that I actually like. Good job!', '2006-12-21 06:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138328, 439364, 69121, '<td valign="top">The dark row of weeds beneath the trees bother me. Other than that I love it.</td>', 'The dark row of weeds beneath the trees bother me. Other than that I love it.', '2006-12-21 06:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138329, 438530, 69121, '<td valign="top">Nice mirror effect.</td>', 'Nice mirror effect.', '2006-12-21 06:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138330, 440078, 69121, '<td valign="top">That is an interesting rock there in the middle. It looks like a snail. Nice job on the cropping. I like the ratio.</td>', 'That is an interesting rock there in the middle. It looks like a snail. Nice job on the cropping. I like the ratio.', '2006-12-21 06:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138331, 440622, 68797, '<td valign="top">I''m missing some sharpness here.</td>', 'I''m missing some sharpness here.', '2006-12-21 06:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138332, 439935, 69121, '<td valign="top">I wish the top line was a little bolder (thicker). It gets hard to see at the top right corner and also near the tip of the pencil.</td>', 'I wish the top line was a little bolder (thicker). It gets hard to see at the top right corner and also near the tip of the pencil.', '2006-12-21 06:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138334, 440142, 69121, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.</td>', 'Very nice photo.', '2006-12-21 06:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138335, 439954, 68797, '<td valign="top">I think if you payed a little more attention to detail it would have been better. Now the brick bothers me.</td>', 'I think if you payed a little more attention to detail it would have been better. Now the brick bothers me.', '2006-12-21 06:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138336, 439670, 69121, '<td valign="top">This is nice.</td>', 'This is nice.', '2006-12-21 06:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138337, 438347, 68797, '<td valign="top">Oh my...I really don''t like the reflections in the glass. I see all kinds of things laying around.</td>', 'Oh my...I really don''t like the reflections in the glass. I see all kinds of things laying around.', '2006-12-21 06:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138338, 440278, 69121, '<td valign="top">Good job. I bet it would look even better zoomed in a little more.</td>', 'Good job. I bet it would look even better zoomed in a little more.', '2006-12-21 06:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138339, 440617, 69183, '<td valign="top">This would be better if it was shot with more light to reduce the size of the pupil and make the iris larger (eg more brown, less black). Also, when you submit, try to make sure at least one of the image dimensions is the maximum allowed (640 pixels) - the larger the image the more impact it''ll have.</td>', 'This would be better if it was shot with more light to reduce the size of the pupil and make the iris larger (eg more brown, less black). Also, when you submit, try to make sure at least one of the image dimensions is the maximum allowed (640 pixels) - the larger the image the more impact it''ll have.', '2006-12-21 06:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138341, 438669, 69121, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2006-12-21 07:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138343, 440509, 69121, '<td valign="top">I wish the subject of this photo was a little more obvious.</td>', 'I wish the subject of this photo was a little more obvious.', '2006-12-21 07:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138344, 439345, 69183, '<td valign="top">Shame that the top of the mug is cut off</td>', 'Shame that the top of the mug is cut off', '2006-12-21 07:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138346, 440012, 69121, '<td valign="top">A little less light on the face would make this much prettier.</td>', 'A little less light on the face would make this much prettier.', '2006-12-21 07:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138347, 439935, 68797, '<td valign="top">well done, like the diagonal lines.</td>', 'well done, like the diagonal lines.', '2006-12-21 07:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138348, 439812, 69121, '<td valign="top">Sticking that tire in there was a fun idea. It kept the photo from being too boring.</td>', 'Sticking that tire in there was a fun idea. It kept the photo from being too boring.', '2006-12-21 07:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138349, 440330, 69121, '<td valign="top">That doesn''t even look apetizing to me. Good picture though.</td>', 'That doesn''t even look apetizing to me. Good picture though.', '2006-12-21 07:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138351, 439724, 69121, '<td valign="top">It looks like her lips are more in focus than her eyes. I think this would look much crisper if her eyes were in focus. It is a very nice photo though.</td>', 'It looks like her lips are more in focus than her eyes. I think this would look much crisper if her eyes were in focus. It is a very nice photo though.', '2006-12-21 07:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138352, 440533, 68797, '<td valign="top">hmmm... I''m trying to comment on each photo but don''t really know what to say about this one.</td>', 'hmmm... I''m trying to comment on each photo but don''t really know what to say about this one.', '2006-12-21 07:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138353, 439285, 69121, '<td valign="top">Good title. The leaves on the ground look great.</td>', 'Good title. The leaves on the ground look great.', '2006-12-21 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138356, 440193, 69183, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very brown skies. That''s some pollution problem you have going on there ;)<br/>Nice shot, love the clouds, but I suspect the recolouring won''t go down well with some.</td>', 'Wow. Very brown skies. That''s some pollution problem you have going on there ;)Nice shot, love the clouds, but I suspect the recolouring won''t go down well with some.', '2006-12-21 07:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138357, 440638, 68797, '<td valign="top">I think the flash is too bright.</td>', 'I think the flash is too bright.', '2006-12-21 07:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138359, 440464, 65468, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but the lighting?</td>', 'Not a bad idea but the lighting?', '2006-12-21 07:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138360, 440381, 69121, '<td valign="top">There is no need to show so much of the container. I would crop some off the bottom.</td>', 'There is no need to show so much of the container. I would crop some off the bottom.', '2006-12-21 07:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138361, 440256, 68797, '<td valign="top">She looks sad...</td>', 'She looks sad...', '2006-12-21 07:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138362, 440500, 68797, '<td valign="top">no sorry, the flowers en berries should not have been there.</td>', 'no sorry, the flowers en berries should not have been there.', '2006-12-21 07:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138363, 440242, 68797, '<td valign="top">lovely cat, more blue than brown in the photo.</td>', 'lovely cat, more blue than brown in the photo.', '2006-12-21 07:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138364, 440310, 69183, '<td valign="top">He''s gonna do himself a serious shoulder injury there...</td>', 'He''s gonna do himself a serious shoulder injury there...', '2006-12-21 07:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138365, 440601, 68797, '<td valign="top">Nice! nice touch with the gloves and coat.</td>', 'Nice! nice touch with the gloves and coat.', '2006-12-21 07:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138366, 439900, 68797, '<td valign="top">It''s crooked... I''m sorry it''s not my cup of tea.</td>', 'It''s crooked... I''m sorry it''s not my cup of tea.', '2006-12-21 07:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138368, 440511, 69183, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, this looks almost like a painting. Fantastic!</td>', 'Love the lighting, this looks almost like a painting. Fantastic!', '2006-12-21 07:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138369, 440349, 69121, '<td valign="top">Where did you get this idea from?</td>', 'Where did you get this idea from?', '2006-12-21 07:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138370, 439409, 68797, '<td valign="top">very nice woodstructure, good lighting.</td>', 'very nice woodstructure, good lighting.', '2006-12-21 07:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138371, 439676, 69121, '<td valign="top">This would make a great painting. You could sell it for millions years after your own (possibly faked) death.</td>', 'This would make a great painting. You could sell it for millions years after your own (possibly faked) death.', '2006-12-21 07:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138372, 440398, 69121, '<td valign="top">That water looks great.</td>', 'That water looks great.', '2006-12-21 07:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138373, 440074, 68797, '<td valign="top">Eventhough this photo must be very hard to make, I don''t like bugs.</td>', 'Eventhough this photo must be very hard to make, I don''t like bugs.', '2006-12-21 07:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138374, 439865, 65468, '<td valign="top">Flat lighting lack of depth in color</td>', 'Flat lighting lack of depth in color', '2006-12-21 07:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138375, 439363, 69121, '<td valign="top">The bird is kind of hard to find given the colors. His neck and head blend right into the tree behind it. The legs do the same. Other than that I like it.</td>', 'The bird is kind of hard to find given the colors. His neck and head blend right into the tree behind it. The legs do the same. Other than that I like it.', '2006-12-21 07:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138376, 440601, 69121, '<td valign="top">Nice title. The piece of wood along the right edge is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice title. The piece of wood along the right edge is a little distracting.', '2006-12-21 07:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138377, 440323, 68797, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you put a lot of thought in this picture but it is still a bit boring to me.</td>', 'I''m sure you put a lot of thought in this picture but it is still a bit boring to me.', '2006-12-21 07:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138378, 440647, 65468, '<td valign="top">i have been trying to get a deer shot all year, congrats on a nice image that fits well to this challenge.</td>', 'i have been trying to get a deer shot all year, congrats on a nice image that fits well to this challenge.', '2006-12-21 07:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138379, 440074, 69121, '<td valign="top">The head looks just a tad out of focus. Nice work capturing it though. I bet it was a bugger to chase down.</td>', 'The head looks just a tad out of focus. Nice work capturing it though. I bet it was a bugger to chase down.', '2006-12-21 07:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138382, 440504, 69121, '<td valign="top">I like the embossed look. Nice choice in color for the border as well.</td>', 'I like the embossed look. Nice choice in color for the border as well.', '2006-12-21 07:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138383, 439170, 68797, '<td valign="top">Not my thing, I''m sorry</td>', 'Not my thing, I''m sorry', '2006-12-21 07:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138384, 440537, 69121, '<td valign="top">I doubt she would eat that...too fatening.</td>', 'I doubt she would eat that...too fatening.', '2006-12-21 07:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138385, 440340, 68797, '<td valign="top">Nice light! I would''ve cropped the bottom right corner out.</td>', 'Nice light! I would''ve cropped the bottom right corner out.', '2006-12-21 07:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138387, 439952, 69121, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the depth-of-view. The image is a little boring though.</td>', 'Nice job with the depth-of-view. The image is a little boring though.', '2006-12-21 07:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138388, 439982, 68797, '<td valign="top">I''m missing some sharpness. Could you not get any closer?</td>', 'I''m missing some sharpness. Could you not get any closer?', '2006-12-21 07:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138389, 439415, 69121, '<td valign="top">Pink Floyd perhaps? I think the black border is just a little too strong if you are going to have white as well.</td>', 'Pink Floyd perhaps? I think the black border is just a little too strong if you are going to have white as well.', '2006-12-21 07:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138390, 439173, 69121, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2006-12-21 07:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138391, 439595, 68797, '<td valign="top">Not my thing, I''m sorry</td>', 'Not my thing, I''m sorry', '2006-12-21 07:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
