(3144242, 440062, 41675, '<td valign="top">There''s something about your photo I really like, although I can''t truly point out any one aspect. Perhaps its just the overall composition. The different browns, the simplicity or just the peaceful feeling I get when looking at it. I just know I like it. :-) Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There''s something about your photo I really like, although I can''t truly point out any one aspect. Perhaps its just the overall composition. The different browns, the simplicity or just the peaceful feeling I get when looking at it. I just know I like it. :-) Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-23 08:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
