(3144256, 440415, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, yum! I just finished making a batch myself. :-) Nice closeup...I wonder if mine have cooled down enough to "taste-test" - you''ve made me hungry for one. Good lighting too.</td>', 'Hmmm, yum! I just finished making a batch myself. :-) Nice closeup...I wonder if mine have cooled down enough to "taste-test" - you''ve made me hungry for one. Good lighting too.', '2006-12-23 08:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
