(3146808, 439595, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think this could use a little more sharpness; but, nevertheless, it''s one of the best shots I''ve seen so far. Great work (and nice holiday theme  :-D).</td>', 'I think this could use a little more sharpness; but, nevertheless, it''s one of the best shots I''ve seen so far. Great work (and nice holiday theme  :-D).', '2006-12-24 22:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
