(3147722, 440455, 67697, '<td valign="top">Could very well be my eyes, but I would like to have seen more of the pic be in focus.</td>', 'Could very well be my eyes, but I would like to have seen more of the pic be in focus.', '2006-12-25 12:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
