(3148184, 438347, 66952, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but, since you have full control of everything in the picture, doing a still life like this requires a level of perfectionism that goes way beyond other types of photography. In this shot, we can see everything on your desk, which pulls focus away from the candle and the glass. You might want to use a sheet to hide everything. Also, the glass appears to be either scratched or dirty. For a brown challenge, there isn''t much brown. You might try putting something brown in the background to make the amaretto darker.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but, since you have full control of everything in the picture, doing a still life like this requires a level of perfectionism that goes way beyond other types of photography. In this shot, we can see everything on your desk, which pulls focus away from the candle and the glass. You might want to use a sheet to hide everything. Also, the glass appears to be either scratched or dirty. For a brown challenge, there isn''t much brown. You might try putting something brown in the background to make the amaretto darker.', '2006-12-25 15:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148185, 439707, 66952, '<td valign="top">Why are the nuts sitting on top of Yao Ming? I don''t get it. The newspaper doesn''t seem to add anything to the composition.</td>', 'Why are the nuts sitting on top of Yao Ming? I don''t get it. The newspaper doesn''t seem to add anything to the composition.', '2006-12-25 15:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148187, 439392, 66952, '<td valign="top">hmmm...There''s some brown, but I''m not sure what the focus of the picture is.</td>', 'hmmm...There''s some brown, but I''m not sure what the focus of the picture is.', '2006-12-25 15:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148237, 440663, 70377, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-12-25 16:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148255, 440505, 36397, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro, the sharpness is slightly less than I would like to see, good compostion</td>', 'Interesting macro, the sharpness is slightly less than I would like to see, good compostion', '2006-12-25 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148257, 439071, 36397, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, the resolution is not enough to clearly see the trees against the sky, not your fault though, must be a limitation because of the maximum # pixels / photograph that can be submitted, I have struggled with this before and do not really know how to get around this problem. 7</td>', 'I like the picture, the resolution is not enough to clearly see the trees against the sky, not your fault though, must be a limitation because of the maximum # pixels / photograph that can be submitted, I have struggled with this before and do not really know how to get around this problem. 7', '2006-12-25 16:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
