(3148281, 440235, 20124, '<td valign="top">This gets  a 10 in adorableness, but less than perfect on a few counts. Picture sharpness is barely adequate. Picture size barely meets the minimum requirements. Not your fault, but there are many entrants who chose<br/>to use a young kid for this challenge, so not great in originality.<br/>   Despite these negatives, a 7.</td>', 'This gets  a 10 in adorableness, but less than perfect on a few counts. Picture sharpness is barely adequate. Picture size barely meets the minimum requirements. Not your fault, but there are many entrants who choseto use a young kid for this challenge, so not great in originality.   Despite these negatives, a 7.', '2006-12-25 17:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148284, 439484, 20124, '<td valign="top">Besides this being way out of focus, the bright whites are very distracting.<br/>  I give it a three. It''s only that high because it  is  in fact brown.</td>', 'Besides this being way out of focus, the bright whites are very distracting.  I give it a three. It''s only that high because it  is  in fact brown.', '2006-12-25 17:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
