(3148293, 440266, 20124, '<td valign="top">Well done. Not only does this fit the challenge theme, but combined<br/>with the title, "life and death" it''s even profound, as a living leaf<br/>is used as a background.<br/>  And technically, I like the sharp details on this closeup.<br/>  An 8</td>', 'Well done. Not only does this fit the challenge theme, but combinedwith the title, "life and death" it''s even profound, as a living leafis used as a background.  And technically, I like the sharp details on this closeup.  An 8', '2006-12-25 17:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
