(3149414, 440367, 70375, '<td valign="top">I, personally, would have liked to see a wall with a brown "wash" on it... not a dark one that would have distracted from the subject "shoes" but something complimentary to kind of "help" the eye along the photo... JMO Good shot though!</td>', 'I, personally, would have liked to see a wall with a brown "wash" on it... not a dark one that would have distracted from the subject "shoes" but something complimentary to kind of "help" the eye along the photo... JMO Good shot though!', '2006-12-26 10:34:30.000000', NULL, 1);
