(3149908, 440344, 59415, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I don''t know how much effore you would have to put in to get this shot, but I am sure it was a bunch.  Wonderful.  My guess is a ribbon of some sort.</td>', 'Wow.  I don''t know how much effore you would have to put in to get this shot, but I am sure it was a bunch.  Wonderful.  My guess is a ribbon of some sort.', '2006-12-26 14:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3149912, 439071, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think the tree dead center doesn''t lend itself very well in this one.  Wonderful color in the shot, and great tones. 7</td>', 'I think the tree dead center doesn''t lend itself very well in this one.  Wonderful color in the shot, and great tones. 7', '2006-12-26 14:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
