(3149915, 440638, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think this would score higher if the hair was put into a pattern of some sort.  Also the skin tones are just a little blown out for my taste. 6</td>', 'I think this would score higher if the hair was put into a pattern of some sort.  Also the skin tones are just a little blown out for my taste. 6', '2006-12-26 14:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
