(3149917, 440500, 59415, '<td valign="top">What amazing colors in this shot!  Wonderful contrast that makes this shot have a happy vibe.  I don''t care for the bottom of the leaf being cut out but other than that, nice job.</td>', 'What amazing colors in this shot!  Wonderful contrast that makes this shot have a happy vibe.  I don''t care for the bottom of the leaf being cut out but other than that, nice job.', '2006-12-26 14:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
