(3149938, 440091, 59415, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a special shot.  Great image, I am sure you already know that though as I am sure 23 people have already told you that.  Good luck and happy ribboning.</td>', 'Wow this is a special shot.  Great image, I am sure you already know that though as I am sure 23 people have already told you that.  Good luck and happy ribboning.', '2006-12-26 15:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
