(3150058, 438563, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.</td>', 'Nice concept.', '2006-12-26 16:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150059, 440661, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great composition. There''s a real feeling of movement to it. I think it''s a bit of a stretch to meet this challenge though. But still, very well taken.</td>', 'Great composition. There''s a real feeling of movement to it. I think it''s a bit of a stretch to meet this challenge though. But still, very well taken.', '2006-12-26 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150060, 439507, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition. Well taken.</td>', 'Nice simple composition. Well taken.', '2006-12-26 16:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150064, 439170, 46314, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit muddled. Not quite abstract enough to be abstract, and not clear enough to make sense.</td>', 'Composition is a bit muddled. Not quite abstract enough to be abstract, and not clear enough to make sense.', '2006-12-26 16:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150068, 439839, 46314, '<td valign="top">Cute. Highlights a bit blown though.</td>', 'Cute. Highlights a bit blown though.', '2006-12-26 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150069, 438886, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Excellent clarity and sharpness.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Excellent clarity and sharpness.', '2006-12-26 17:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150070, 440173, 46662, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling that this is soft, crisp and peaceful all at once :)</td>', 'I like the feeling that this is soft, crisp and peaceful all at once :)', '2006-12-26 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150071, 439473, 46314, '<td valign="top">Composition lacks punch. Would have liked to see the brown tones dominate more.</td>', 'Composition lacks punch. Would have liked to see the brown tones dominate more.', '2006-12-26 17:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150072, 440536, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great tones in this photo. Nice capture.</td>', 'Great tones in this photo. Nice capture.', '2006-12-26 17:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150073, 440547, 46662, '<td valign="top">Would have thrown the back out a bit more - interesting colours though!</td>', 'Would have thrown the back out a bit more - interesting colours though!', '2006-12-26 17:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150074, 438669, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love the shot - amazing clarity and sharpness. Not sure if it feels brown enough for me though.</td>', 'I love the shot - amazing clarity and sharpness. Not sure if it feels brown enough for me though.', '2006-12-26 17:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150075, 440145, 46314, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem brown enough for me, but I love the composition. Would make a great poster.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem brown enough for me, but I love the composition. Would make a great poster.', '2006-12-26 17:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150078, 440504, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great post processing. Really turned it into a work of art. Not sure if it meets the challenge well though - would prefer more brown tones.</td>', 'Nice shot. Great post processing. Really turned it into a work of art. Not sure if it meets the challenge well though - would prefer more brown tones.', '2006-12-26 17:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150080, 438887, 46662, '<td valign="top">Great composition, cropping &amp; colours.  <br/> <br/>If I''m being anal I''d say I''m not entirely comfortable with the field of focus though, as the top cigar is OOF but the bottom one is in focus  &amp; the middle somewhere in between.</td>', 'Great composition, cropping & colours.   If I''m being anal I''d say I''m not entirely comfortable with the field of focus though, as the top cigar is OOF but the bottom one is in focus  & the middle somewhere in between.', '2006-12-26 17:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150081, 440592, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the attitude you captured in the image.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the attitude you captured in the image.', '2006-12-26 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150083, 440348, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in this shot. The texture of the leaves on the trees is so fine. Well focused too.</td>', 'I love the detail in this shot. The texture of the leaves on the trees is so fine. Well focused too.', '2006-12-26 17:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150085, 439865, 46662, '<td valign="top">I like where this is coming from, but think you should have upped the saturation and contrast (or temp) a little bit.  Feels a little cold.</td>', 'I like where this is coming from, but think you should have upped the saturation and contrast (or temp) a little bit.  Feels a little cold.', '2006-12-26 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150088, 440145, 46662, '<td valign="top">fab composition.  Would have made it a bit browner all over though! contrast or hue perhaps?</td>', 'fab composition.  Would have made it a bit browner all over though! contrast or hue perhaps?', '2006-12-26 17:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150089, 439364, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the compositions. The lines create a powerful flow through the image.</td>', 'I like the compositions. The lines create a powerful flow through the image.', '2006-12-26 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150091, 439724, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and tones. Might have been a bit improved by a bit more sharpness around the eyes.</td>', 'Nice composition and tones. Might have been a bit improved by a bit more sharpness around the eyes.', '2006-12-26 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150094, 439012, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the powerful shapes. But the yellow seems to dominate far more than the brown...</td>', 'Great shot. I like the powerful shapes. But the yellow seems to dominate far more than the brown...', '2006-12-26 17:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150096, 440275, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting shot.</td>', 'Not a very interesting shot.', '2006-12-26 17:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150097, 438943, 46314, '<td valign="top">Needed more depth of field. Would have looked better if the text was focussed too.</td>', 'Needed more depth of field. Would have looked better if the text was focussed too.', '2006-12-26 17:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150101, 440541, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Fits the challenge well, and is well taken and composed. Might have made more of a brown impact if you''d processed the colour a bit to bring out more brown tones.</td>', 'Great shot. Fits the challenge well, and is well taken and composed. Might have made more of a brown impact if you''d processed the colour a bit to bring out more brown tones.', '2006-12-26 17:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150104, 440667, 46314, '<td valign="top">Brown? Maybe if you turned him 90 degrees... :-)</td>', 'Brown? Maybe if you turned him 90 degrees... :-)', '2006-12-26 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150106, 439670, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken, and good tones, but the composition seems to be lacking any interest.</td>', 'Nicely taken, and good tones, but the composition seems to be lacking any interest.', '2006-12-26 17:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150110, 439419, 46314, '<td valign="top">The eye looks too soft. Needed more clarity and sharpness.</td>', 'The eye looks too soft. Needed more clarity and sharpness.', '2006-12-26 17:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150113, 438347, 46314, '<td valign="top">You needed to clear up the clutter on your set more. There are far too many distracting reflections. Also, I don''t feel it meets the ''brown'' challenge well.</td>', 'You needed to clear up the clutter on your set more. There are far too many distracting reflections. Also, I don''t feel it meets the ''brown'' challenge well.', '2006-12-26 17:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150116, 440289, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting building. Thanks for showing it to us.</td>', 'Interesting building. Thanks for showing it to us.', '2006-12-26 17:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150124, 440244, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love bears. Nicely taken. That leaf is distracting, but I know it would have been impossible for you to get rid of it (either when taking or editing, because of the rules). Maybe a tighter crop? <br/>Either way, it doesn''t take away too much from the beauty of the creature. And the focus is good. The sharpness brings out the texture of his coat well.</td>', 'I love bears. Nicely taken. That leaf is distracting, but I know it would have been impossible for you to get rid of it (either when taking or editing, because of the rules). Maybe a tighter crop? Either way, it doesn''t take away too much from the beauty of the creature. And the focus is good. The sharpness brings out the texture of his coat well.', '2006-12-26 17:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150127, 440631, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition, but the lighting comes off a bit flat. Maybe you could have bumped up the contrast a bit?</td>', 'Nice subject and composition, but the lighting comes off a bit flat. Maybe you could have bumped up the contrast a bit?', '2006-12-26 17:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150128, 438565, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough.</td>', 'Not sharp enough.', '2006-12-26 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150131, 440624, 46314, '<td valign="top">Awesome pose. A tighter crop might have emphasised that cheeky look even more. And it also would have removed some of the coloured clutter that distracts from the brown tones. Although, if this wasn''t a brown challenge, it''s a splendid animal portrait.</td>', 'Awesome pose. A tighter crop might have emphasised that cheeky look even more. And it also would have removed some of the coloured clutter that distracts from the brown tones. Although, if this wasn''t a brown challenge, it''s a splendid animal portrait.', '2006-12-26 17:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150132, 440311, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Well taken.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Well taken.', '2006-12-26 17:20:41.000000', NULL, 1);
