(3151831, 440381, 24454, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm. . .brown that makes me feel all warm and cozy inside.  This would make such a great wall hanger in one of those country nostalgic kitchens, right? :)<br/> <br/>Great job!  As always!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Mmmmm. . .brown that makes me feel all warm and cozy inside.  This would make such a great wall hanger in one of those country nostalgic kitchens, right? :) Great job!  As always! ', '2006-12-27 01:27:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3151869, 440365, 46314, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. It wasn''t quite the pose I wanted from Max, but he was quite skittish in front of the camera, and this was about the only shot I got of him sitting still.<br/> <br/>So for those who thought he looked odd or scared, he was. He was a stray who''s had a tough life, so he still gets pretty nervous around people - the camera really intimidated him.<br/> <br/>Still, I think this photo captured his gorgeous chocolate colour nicely. He''s quite an attractive dog.<br/> <br/><i>Lenny D: I know what you mean - the nose does look out of proportion - but I think that''s mainly due the the angle, and the fact that he has a big nose. I doubt it''s distortion from the lens, since it was a 50mm prime.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments. It wasn''t quite the pose I wanted from Max, but he was quite skittish in front of the camera, and this was about the only shot I got of him sitting still. So for those who thought he looked odd or scared, he was. He was a stray who''s had a tough life, so he still gets pretty nervous around people - the camera really intimidated him. Still, I think this photo captured his gorgeous chocolate colour nicely. He''s quite an attractive dog. Lenny D: I know what you mean - the nose does look out of proportion - but I think that''s mainly due the the angle, and the fact that he has a big nose. I doubt it''s distortion from the lens, since it was a 50mm prime.', '2006-12-27 01:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3151891, 440635, 15266, '<td valign="top">Go, Shannon, go!  This is lovely and deserved a nice finish.</td>', 'Go, Shannon, go!  This is lovely and deserved a nice finish.', '2006-12-27 01:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
