(3152055, 440485, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very high marks for brown, but I like all the other things as well - the highlights, the reflections - they give a mysterious context, and really as a caffeine addict, the essence of coffee is the unbeatable if illusory lightness of being? Steam rising. (I have problems with the border, not just the mentioned off centredness, but I would consider white alone without the inner and outer brown/black OR maybe an even wider white border with whatever.  Not something I would let influence my vote).</td>', 'Very high marks for brown, but I like all the other things as well - the highlights, the reflections - they give a mysterious context, and really as a caffeine addict, the essence of coffee is the unbeatable if illusory lightness of being? Steam rising. (I have problems with the border, not just the mentioned off centredness, but I would consider white alone without the inner and outer brown/black OR maybe an even wider white border with whatever.  Not something I would let influence my vote).', '2006-12-27 01:54:57.000000', NULL, 0),
