(3153031, 440214, 811, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DiggyMacD:</b></div><hr/><i> Delightful shot, strong image and feeling.  But not primarily about brown. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your comment, but if you see this, exactly what do you mean "not about brown."</td>', 'Originally posted by DiggyMacD: Delightful shot, strong image and feeling.  But not primarily about brown.   Thank you for your comment, but if you see this, exactly what do you mean "not about brown."', '2006-12-27 09:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3153035, 440450, 40386, '<td valign="top">Great finish.  I love these slow motion shots with the motion blur and believe it or not they are not easy to capture successfully.  You nailed it.  Hey I am going to have to step up my efforts a lot Jimmy, you are excelling, in fact I will have to hide my horses from you, you might embarass me LOL. Where are you located again :-). In fact I have only four pictures of myself with my horses all taken by non pros and pretty bad, would love some as I have had about 35 different horses over the past five years and 20 at the moment.<br/> <br/>Horses do have very short spurts of energy so you have to be quick to capture their action or be prepared to sit around for hours until they get their next spurt of energy.<br/></td>', 'Great finish.  I love these slow motion shots with the motion blur and believe it or not they are not easy to capture successfully.  You nailed it.  Hey I am going to have to step up my efforts a lot Jimmy, you are excelling, in fact I will have to hide my horses from you, you might embarass me LOL. Where are you located again :-). In fact I have only four pictures of myself with my horses all taken by non pros and pretty bad, would love some as I have had about 35 different horses over the past five years and 20 at the moment. Horses do have very short spurts of energy so you have to be quick to capture their action or be prepared to sit around for hours until they get their next spurt of energy.', '2006-12-27 09:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
