(3153735, 438585, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful browns, but would like to see a focal point such as an eye. I do like the textures and lighting - looks perfectly exposed.</td>', 'Beautiful browns, but would like to see a focal point such as an eye. I do like the textures and lighting - looks perfectly exposed.', '2006-12-27 14:19:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3153748, 439562, 66597, '<td valign="top">Question for you: have you ever tried adjusting white balance on your camera? I just took a class in lighting, where I learned about white balance, and it opened a whole new world for me. This is a classic example of a photo that might have benefited from a warming filter (open shade setting for very warm, cloud setting for slightly warm). Basically, one of these filters would help alleviate the blue cast (unless, of course, that blue cast was intentional).<br/> <br/>Otherwise- I think you''ve got a pretty strong composition going here, and some nice lines. Looks like you could have used a tripod for a little more exposure. A bit dark.<br/></td>', 'Question for you: have you ever tried adjusting white balance on your camera? I just took a class in lighting, where I learned about white balance, and it opened a whole new world for me. This is a classic example of a photo that might have benefited from a warming filter (open shade setting for very warm, cloud setting for slightly warm). Basically, one of these filters would help alleviate the blue cast (unless, of course, that blue cast was intentional). Otherwise- I think you''ve got a pretty strong composition going here, and some nice lines. Looks like you could have used a tripod for a little more exposure. A bit dark.', '2006-12-27 14:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3153788, 440344, 56797, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried a few times to do this and can''t for the life of me figure out how you get your results. just amazing!! I knew this was the blue within 5 seconds of looking at the challenge thumbnails. fantastic!</td>', 'I''ve tried a few times to do this and can''t for the life of me figure out how you get your results. just amazing!! I knew this was the blue within 5 seconds of looking at the challenge thumbnails. fantastic!', '2006-12-27 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 0),
