(3154273, 440042, 66384, '<td valign="top">Raish, I like this one a lot. The use of the mirror allows us to see the brown of the front of the shoe and the tan of the lining. Cleaver idea. All those brown shades and textures revolving around the subject of a shoe shine are an excellent composition. I really don''t know why it didn''t score higher. Maybe it''s cropped a little tight on the top and bottom, and the mirror doesn''t seem quite clean enough (a little distracting).</td>', 'Raish, I like this one a lot. The use of the mirror allows us to see the brown of the front of the shoe and the tan of the lining. Cleaver idea. All those brown shades and textures revolving around the subject of a shoe shine are an excellent composition. I really don''t know why it didn''t score higher. Maybe it''s cropped a little tight on the top and bottom, and the mirror doesn''t seem quite clean enough (a little distracting).', '2006-12-27 18:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154277, 440344, 68413, '<td valign="top">Great shot Irene! Didn''t see this before challenge closed, otherwise you would have had 48 10''s. Just omg amazing.</td>', 'Great shot Irene! Didn''t see this before challenge closed, otherwise you would have had 48 10''s. Just omg amazing.', '2006-12-27 18:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154284, 440344, 45187, '<td valign="top">Wirklich sehr sehr schoen.  Ausgezeichnet!</td>', 'Wirklich sehr sehr schoen.  Ausgezeichnet!', '2006-12-27 18:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154286, 439614, 60805, '<td valign="top">Thanks Amy :)</td>', 'Thanks Amy :)', '2006-12-27 18:16:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154290, 440518, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is so brown it looks like it has a sepia tint. As a matter of fact, I think I gave it a 5 because of that. I think the sepia shots were pretty poor efforts for the brown challenge. Sorry I lumped yours in with that category. I think these natural brown are very nice, and I should have realized from the blue lens on the camera that it wasn''t a tint.</td>', 'This is so brown it looks like it has a sepia tint. As a matter of fact, I think I gave it a 5 because of that. I think the sepia shots were pretty poor efforts for the brown challenge. Sorry I lumped yours in with that category. I think these natural brown are very nice, and I should have realized from the blue lens on the camera that it wasn''t a tint.', '2006-12-27 18:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154300, 438585, 66384, '<td valign="top">The light and focus is so good I know exactly what it would feel like to stroke the coat. Nice going. Solid technically, but lacks a point of interest.</td>', 'The light and focus is so good I know exactly what it would feel like to stroke the coat. Nice going. Solid technically, but lacks a point of interest.', '2006-12-27 18:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154310, 440324, 29658, '<td valign="top">Well deserved! Congratulations on your first ribbon.</td>', 'Well deserved! Congratulations on your first ribbon.', '2006-12-27 18:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154319, 440382, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the large blur in the foreground. I want to see more of the toe of the shoe. The crop at the top is too tight; it nicks off the top edge of the scallop. The brown is excellent, and the focus (where it is sharp) captures the texture of the leather very nicely. Also I think a diagonal shot might have worked well for this.</td>', 'I don''t care for the large blur in the foreground. I want to see more of the toe of the shoe. The crop at the top is too tight; it nicks off the top edge of the scallop. The brown is excellent, and the focus (where it is sharp) captures the texture of the leather very nicely. Also I think a diagonal shot might have worked well for this.', '2006-12-27 18:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154338, 439614, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice.. is her name ''sandy''? lol<br/></td>', 'nice.. is her name ''sandy''? lol', '2006-12-27 18:50:17.000000', NULL, 0),
