(3154465, 440173, 67145, '<td valign="top">congrats on 6th place and PB!!! ...<br/>imagine you''d be feeling pretty high when you didnt think it''d do well .. just goes to show that the voters do get it right some of the time!!<br/>excellent colours and design .... <br/>real happy for you nick ..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-27 19:28:50.</i></td>', 'congrats on 6th place and PB!!! ...imagine you''d be feeling pretty high when you didnt think it''d do well .. just goes to show that the voters do get it right some of the time!!excellent colours and design .... real happy for you nick ..', '2006-12-27 19:26:21.000000', '2006-12-27 19:28:50.000000', 0),
(3154485, 439614, 60805, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations. It''s lovely.  My only nitpick was the "half nipples."  Seems slightly off - I''d have had them disappear in the sand. ;~D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I wanted to airbrush it out at the last minute and then i realised it was basic :(</td>', 'Originally posted by Jutilda: Congratulations. It''s lovely.  My only nitpick was the "half nipples."  Seems slightly off - I''d have had them disappear in the sand. ;~D   I wanted to airbrush it out at the last minute and then i realised it was basic :(', '2006-12-27 19:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
