(3154707, 440344, 51538, '<td valign="top">Not only did you need the inspiration to make this shot but it also took a lot of perspiration.  I often think that copious amounts of perspiration do not make for good art.  But I think with your project you have proved that picture perfect, as a result of blood, sweat, and tears (of milk) can be very artful.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Not only did you need the inspiration to make this shot but it also took a lot of perspiration.  I often think that copious amounts of perspiration do not make for good art.  But I think with your project you have proved that picture perfect, as a result of blood, sweat, and tears (of milk) can be very artful.  Congratulations.', '2006-12-27 21:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
