(3155003, 440173, 69008, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that it''s an illusion due to the diagonal lines, the curve on the right side, and perspective, but when I look at this image on screen, the sides of the border seem to slant to the right at the top.  Has anyone else noticed this effect? <br/>Just an awesome capture, and I see that you under estimated the power that this image projects.</td>', 'I''m sure that it''s an illusion due to the diagonal lines, the curve on the right side, and perspective, but when I look at this image on screen, the sides of the border seem to slant to the right at the top.  Has anyone else noticed this effect? Just an awesome capture, and I see that you under estimated the power that this image projects.', '2006-12-28 00:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
