(3155805, 440344, 28276, '<td valign="top">well... i knew it was only a matter of time before you took over the top spot in the tamron 90mm lens page.  and you did so with authority.  it''ll be many moons before i get that spot back...  :)<br/> <br/>beautiful work.  congrats!</td>', 'well... i knew it was only a matter of time before you took over the top spot in the tamron 90mm lens page.  and you did so with authority.  it''ll be many moons before i get that spot back...  :) beautiful work.  congrats!', '2006-12-28 10:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3155941, 440320, 12200, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, and for anyone who might have missed the irony of my title or initial description, I was going for sarcasm here. I got my donuts that particular morning, and they looked so good on the rack, but then when I opened the sack and noticed the amount of grease that had been transferred to the paper, I was mildly disgusted. I always thought these were the LOWER fat donuts...and when I held the thing up to the light and noticed how much it seemed to be glistening, I decided it might make a mildly interesting shot to make an otherwise tasty-looking treat appear less appetizing when you get close enough to realize what''s in it. I''m not convinced I succeeded, as the voting seems to indicate. But thanks for everyone''s comments!</td>', 'For what it''s worth, and for anyone who might have missed the irony of my title or initial description, I was going for sarcasm here. I got my donuts that particular morning, and they looked so good on the rack, but then when I opened the sack and noticed the amount of grease that had been transferred to the paper, I was mildly disgusted. I always thought these were the LOWER fat donuts...and when I held the thing up to the light and noticed how much it seemed to be glistening, I decided it might make a mildly interesting shot to make an otherwise tasty-looking treat appear less appetizing when you get close enough to realize what''s in it. I''m not convinced I succeeded, as the voting seems to indicate. But thanks for everyone''s comments!', '2006-12-28 11:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3155957, 440344, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful technically, but more importantly there is a scientific artistic beauty to this shot that is dare I say for lack of a better term, life affirming; like the beauty of a snowflake, you show this, and its nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful technically, but more importantly there is a scientific artistic beauty to this shot that is dare I say for lack of a better term, life affirming; like the beauty of a snowflake, you show this, and its nice work.', '2006-12-28 11:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3156010, 440344, 60009, '<td valign="top">wow just beautiful; this shot inspires me to try the same type of photography.</td>', 'wow just beautiful; this shot inspires me to try the same type of photography.', '2006-12-28 11:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
