(3160048, 440192, 31606, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent in this.  The details are great so the focus is spot on.  I would say the reason it scored the way it did is because the subject is not that interesting.  I think a different perspective would have helped a little.  Maybe looking at it from level and have a loaf of bread in the background just out of focus.  But it is fine the way it is.  Just with over 300+ entries most probably gave you a 5 and went to the next entry.  You need to find a way to stop the viewer and make them think for a minute.</td>', 'The lighting is excellent in this.  The details are great so the focus is spot on.  I would say the reason it scored the way it did is because the subject is not that interesting.  I think a different perspective would have helped a little.  Maybe looking at it from level and have a loaf of bread in the background just out of focus.  But it is fine the way it is.  Just with over 300+ entries most probably gave you a 5 and went to the next entry.  You need to find a way to stop the viewer and make them think for a minute.', '2006-12-29 15:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
