(3161822, 439724, 27482, '<td valign="top">First of all, nice looking lady :)  Well lighting is pretty good, composition too and well pretty much nothing that I can see wrong with this shot except for one big issue, and that is the focus lying slightly in front of her eyes so they are a bit out of focus, take better care when focusing at 1.8 aperture and you should be all set.  Also I personally would have used a higher contrast in post processing but that´s just my taste.</td>', 'First of all, nice looking lady :)  Well lighting is pretty good, composition too and well pretty much nothing that I can see wrong with this shot except for one big issue, and that is the focus lying slightly in front of her eyes so they are a bit out of focus, take better care when focusing at 1.8 aperture and you should be all set.  Also I personally would have used a higher contrast in post processing but that´s just my taste.', '2006-12-30 09:20:19.000000', NULL, 0),
