(3162513, 440506, 44099, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments guys, making 4th is a really big step for me, since I''m used to placing like 40th :)<br/> <br/>About the border...lately I''ve been playing around with borders and this one was no different. It may have looked better if it had a title or something underneath it to give the border a "purpose," but otherwise maybe I shouldn''t have included it. It might have cost me a ribbon...heh, oh well I''m still extremely happy with my placement.<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments guys, making 4th is a really big step for me, since I''m used to placing like 40th :) About the border...lately I''ve been playing around with borders and this one was no different. It may have looked better if it had a title or something underneath it to give the border a "purpose," but otherwise maybe I shouldn''t have included it. It might have cost me a ribbon...heh, oh well I''m still extremely happy with my placement. Thanks again!', '2006-12-30 16:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
