(3193242, 438821, 64629, '<td valign="top">Hello Nilish.,<br/> This is a great photo. Sorry for the DQ. I also had a dq in brown and am not quite sure what I did wrong. Oh well live and learn. Your work is quite remarkable especially in light of your experience and equipment. You are going to do great. You should consider a portfolio on pbase.People there are more relaxed because it is not a competition. I find it a great balance to the feedback I get here.Dont get me wrong I need criticism but it is good to get a different perspective. WWW.pbase.com/clangley50<br/>Very inexpensive and a lot of great people here. Photo-a-day is where you post a pic a day and people check out your work.Anyway keep up the great work<br/> regards clark</td>', 'Hello Nilish., This is a great photo. Sorry for the DQ. I also had a dq in brown and am not quite sure what I did wrong. Oh well live and learn. Your work is quite remarkable especially in light of your experience and equipment. You are going to do great. You should consider a portfolio on pbase.People there are more relaxed because it is not a competition. I find it a great balance to the feedback I get here.Dont get me wrong I need criticism but it is good to get a different perspective. WWW.pbase.com/clangley50Very inexpensive and a lot of great people here. Photo-a-day is where you post a pic a day and people check out your work.Anyway keep up the great work regards clark', '2007-01-07 22:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
