(3202928, 440531, 12268, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! I really have been more &amp; more impressed with your art from each picture you shoot week after week. I love this shot. You have the simplistic yet uniquely creative look down. Will have to tach me a thing or two about this.<br/> <br/>I would be interested to see this shot with a deeper depth of field, I think that would add something to it. The contrast, again, like most of your shots, really on point. Great stuff!<br/>Peace<br/>Rooster</td>', 'Very interesting! I really have been more & more impressed with your art from each picture you shoot week after week. I love this shot. You have the simplistic yet uniquely creative look down. Will have to tach me a thing or two about this. I would be interested to see this shot with a deeper depth of field, I think that would add something to it. The contrast, again, like most of your shots, really on point. Great stuff!PeaceRooster', '2007-01-10 00:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
