(4484541, 439347, 36102, '<td valign="top">Here''s a trick for bugs.  When you catch them in a jar put them in the fridge for about 30 min''s  It won''t kill them, just slow them down, a lot.  This also works well with butterflies.  The pictures look nice because the bug is alive but they don''t move or fly away for a good 10 min''s so you can get that macro shot. <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Here''s a trick for bugs.  When you catch them in a jar put them in the fridge for about 30 min''s  It won''t kill them, just slow them down, a lot.  This also works well with butterflies.  The pictures look nice because the bug is alive but they don''t move or fly away for a good 10 min''s so you can get that macro shot. Nice job.', '2008-02-13 19:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
